{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:78fc17b32a2919f297b5f205192026bc18f04625c5f889513a29400d16e31b24",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d2e7b79e335ff65749f3a8251ea5669ce0f68f8a6b116fd368e53d6fb8340b4",
      "text": "回想起前几天的演唱会，\n我再次觉得，大家真的好厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feee837829f755559a272e399f29afbe4122a8a03b2cc1ca2ec356cc0035271a",
      "text": "是指雪祭的\n事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000009:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42254a7fb17805754bef270e28c550f07d739d69dc4e1c638dc352a90a8f23b3",
      "text": "是指前阵子演出的\n雪祭吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8552d17189ab0f1594bf3262ed5a256f090fd93bf8396d0778e71abf17f67749",
      "text": "嗯。皮埃尔的笑容，\n连看着他的我都会忍不住跟着笑起来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1456f31aa62e80b6c871f4af7f5171973e5a7b0f9a13a299cf7c76183c9c128",
      "text": "秀非常可靠……\n做雪雕的时候，也是他最麻利了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92ed583b0efd092291b6f0e5ef17162a331d9af531ab450e6023ea99499522a",
      "text": "冬马先生毕竟经验丰富，\n在演唱会中也非常帅气地带领着大家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d27e95650f133d249077a9b80afab2593a681de8a4b9d9976a3944959d249dc8",
      "text": "正因为身边都是这么厉害的伙伴，\n所以我觉得自己也必须变得更帅气才行啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9ae31a3661bced5623fcfde0db9116eabfbd2a8726f47941b672eefb8786c1b",
      "text": "隼人先生也很帅气哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8553b76206755b741547fed1783fb9db32d2cb352a4a07393b035cdfe189d474",
      "text": "已经足够帅气了哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cb27e82b0196e82f2ee76616444b4cafb42740e750743e2e4b1f921cad8e7bb",
      "text": "哎！是、是这样吗！？\n嘿嘿……怪不好意思的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e663e4330f6ce954da4a066bb15dff1179ea8f60566bf91d0fb344b1ff6a64a",
      "text": "谢谢你鼓励我！\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:020hay_401_2_4_020_01_09_a:2_4_020_01_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cee58fb1034575e2e660338d449947e139b9500378e1143b4e1a17e136348597",
      "text": "我不会光去拿自己跟别人比较，\n也要试着磨炼属于我自己的帅气！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
